  "notes": [
    "All p.43–52 photos and p.53 boundary were visually checked. p.52 is a blank notes page.",
    "36 numbered + 9 independently headed unnumbered terms = 45 heads. old-fashioned and democrat are inline supplements, not independent headword blocks.",
    "score, replenish, portion sth out, lift, sweetheart and dress are retained from explicit book labels omitted by the older raw captures.",
    "appeal is vi./n.; desert/dessert keeps the printed 似 label without inventing a confuse relation.",
    "science occurs twice and scientist is also a printed supplement under scientific; preserve explicit occurrences, deduplicate dictionary IDs only when resolving group words.",
    "passage of time and be sorry for sth appear only inside running examples, so they are not adopted as separately approved patterns. All running example sentences are excluded.",
    "spilled/spilt and handkerchiefs are preserved as printed form labels in usage; no inferred lemma aliases or new formal rows.",
    "Mapping is exact headword or an explicitly stored existing wordVariants entry; actual officialWord is preserved. No fuzzy matching or new alias is created."
  ]
}
